      "title": "Benefits for Faculty and Staff",
      "description": "Benefits for Faculty and Staff | Office of Human Resources Skip to main\n      content FSU | Office of Human Resources Webmail Search FSU Navigation This Site FSU Sites Faculty & Staff Directory Departments & Services Home About Us Leadership Contacts Strategic Initiatives Locations Working at FSU Search Jobs Prospective Employees New Employees Current Employees LCA Notice of Filing Employee Development Total Rewards Compensation Leave Plans Seminole Savings Insurance Retirement Policies Communications Distributions HR News Announcements Employee of the Year Policies Calendars Department Representative Resources Reports Sections Attendance & Leave Benefits for Faculty and Staff Compensation Services Training & Organizational Development Employee Data Management Employee & Labor Relations Employment Services Equal Opportunity Compliance & Engagement HR Satellite Offices Ombuds Program Faculty Relations HR Records Academics Admissions Research Faculty Students Veterans Support FSU Office of Human Resources Toggle navigation Home About Us Leadership Contacts Strategic Initiatives Locations Working at FSU Search Jobs Prospective Employees New Employees Current Employees LCA Notice of Filing Employee Development Total Rewards Compensation Leave Plans Seminole Savings Insurance Retirement Policies Communications Distributions HR News Announcements Employee of the Year Policies Calendars Department Representative Resources Reports Sections Attendance & Leave Benefits for Faculty and Staff Compensation Services Training & Organizational Development Employee Data Management Employee & Labor Relations Employment Services Equal Opportunity Compliance & Engagement HR Satellite Offices Ombuds Program Faculty Relations HR Records Attendance & Leave Benefits for Faculty and Staff Compensation Services Training & Organizational Development Employee Data Management Employee & Labor Relations Employment Services Equal Opportunity Compliance & Engagement HR Satellite Offices Ombuds Program Faculty Relations HR Records Home Sections Benefits for Faculty and Staff Benefits for Faculty and Staff Florida State University offers employees the opportunity to participate in a variety of benefit programs. It is mandatory for all employees to participate in one of three retirement plans. All insurance programs are voluntary and include pre-tax and post-tax options. People First is the Benefits Administrator for the State of Florida pre-tax insurance plans and is responsible for new hire enrollments, coverage changes, premium administration, and dependent eligibility, among many others. Insurance Benefits & Perks Retirement Benefit Summary The online New Employee Orientation (NEO) is available for employees to review all available insurance, retirement, and additional benefits. Employee Insurance Eligibility To comply with the federally-mandated provisions of the 2010 Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act, Florida State University offers State of Florida Group Health Insurance coverage as an optional benefit for all qualified OPS employees. The coverage is subject to change based on state and federal legislation. Employees who meet the measuring guidelines, including graduate assistants and adjunct faculty, will be notified by People First to elect coverage. Important Employee Reminder Employee Eligibility -- Salaried & OPS IRS 1095 Forms Break in Service -- Insurance Reinstatement Between Positions (Salaried/OPS) Measurement Matrix -- New Hire and Open Enrollment Measurement Periods Market Place Exchange Notice Important Web Links Government Healthcare Affordable Care Act (ACA) Old Publications with important benefit reminders: 8/9/2021 1/21/2020 12/13/2016 3/21/2016 Should you have any questions or concerns about the implementation of the OPS Health Insurance Plan, please contact the FSU Human Resources Benefits Office at (850) 644-4015 or email insurance@fsu.edu . People First Links The State of Florida’s MyBenefits website provides information regarding available benefit options to eligible state agency and state university employees. The links provided are the most frequently used. Forms Dependent Eligibility Verification Process Insurance Provider Contact Information COBRA Resources Contact General Inquiries Insurance/Retirement: Phone: 850-644-6034 Retirement: retirement@fsu.edu Fax: 850-645-9509 Insurance: insurance@fsu.edu Fax: 850-644-7041 Tyler Beasley Sr. HR Specialist 850-644-9641 Email Stacey Coats Assistant Director, Benefits 850-644-7932 Email Rowan Meagher HR Specialist 850-644-5726 Email Jennifer Stamper Senior HR Specialist 850-644-7707 Email Kaitlyn Stroud HR Specialist 850-644-4016 Email Charles Whiting HR Specialist 850-644-9615 Email Christine Conley Director, Benefits/Attendance & Leave 850-644-1978 Email Resources Student Health Insurance GA Health Subsidy Postdoctoral Scholars Office of Human Resources 282 Champions Way A6200 University Center Tallahassee, Florida 32306 Phone: (850) 644-6034 Fax: (850) 645-9508 Email: hr@fsu.edu Florida Board of Governors Statement of Free Expression The State University System of Florida and its twelve public postsecondary institutions adopt this Statement on Free Expression to support and encourage full and open discourse and the robust exchange of ideas and perspectives on our respective campuses... Read the full statement © Florida State University Tallahassee, FL 32306 FSU Directory Assistance Questions or Comments Privacy Policy Copyright Like Florida State on Facebook Follow Florida State on Instagram Follow Florida State on X Follow Florida State on Youtube Connect with Florida State on LinkedIn More FSU Social Media Cookie Preferences"
